  "description": "Janglim is a general-purpose, embeddable LR/LALR parser-generator engine for .NET. Define a grammar in C#, then parse with incremental reparsing, error recovery, and grammar introspection (parse tables, FIRST/FOLLOW, conflict reports). Early preview — the public API is still unstable.",
